sequenceDiagram
    participant FS as Field Staff
    participant MOBILE as Mobile App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant WS as Workflow Service
    participant FS_SVC as File Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant UI as Web Interface
    participant QC as QC SPOC
    participant SPOC as Activity SPOC
    participant AS as Audit Service
    
    Note over FS,AS: Activity Report Submission and Review Workflow
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Open assigned facility
    MOBILE->>API: GET /api/v1/facility-activities/{id}?include=facility,activity
    API->>WS: Get facility activity details
    WS->>DB: Query facility activity with related data
    DB-->>WS: Return facility activity details
    WS-->>API: Return complete facility data
    API-->>MOBILE: Display facility information
    MOBILE-->>FS: Show facility details and activity form
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Start activity execution
    MOBILE->>MOBILE: Load activity form template
    Note over MOBILE: Form fields based on activity type (Installation, QC, etc.)
    
    FS->>FS: Perform field activity
    Note over FS: Take photos, measurements, complete checklist
    
    loop Data Collection
        FS->>MOBILE: Fill form fields
        FS->>MOBILE: Capture photos/documents
        MOBILE->>MOBILE: Store data locally (offline support)
        
        alt Internet Available
            MOBILE->>API: POST /api/v1/facility-activities/{id}/auto-save
            API->>WS: Auto-save progress
            WS->>DB: Update progress status
            DB-->>WS: Progress saved
            WS-->>API: Return save confirmation
            API-->>MOBILE: Show "Progress saved"
        else Offline Mode
            Note over MOBILE: Data stored locally for later sync
        end
    end
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Complete activity and submit report
    MOBILE->>MOBILE: Validate form completion
    
    alt Form Validation Errors
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show validation errors
        FS->>MOBILE: Fix errors and resubmit
    else Form Valid
        MOBILE->>API: POST /api/v1/activity-reports (multipart with files)
        API->>WS: Process report submission
        
        WS->>FS_SVC: Upload attached files (photos, documents)
        FS_SVC->>FS_SVC: Validate file types and sizes
        
        alt File Validation Errors
            FS_SVC-->>WS: Return file errors
            WS-->>API: Return validation errors
            API-->>MOBILE: Show file errors
            MOBILE-->>FS: "Invalid file format or size"
        else Files Valid
            FS_SVC->>FS_SVC: Store files securely
            FS_SVC-->>WS: Return file URLs
            
            WS->>DB: Begin transaction
            WS->>DB: Create activity_reports record
            DB-->>WS: Return report ID
            
            WS->>DB: Update facility_activities status to COMPLETED
            WS->>DB: Set completed_at timestamp
            DB-->>WS: Status updated
            
            WS->>DB: Commit transaction
            DB-->>WS: Report submitted successfully
            
            WS->>AS: Log report submission audit
            AS->>DB: Store audit record
            DB-->>AS: Audit logged
            
            WS->>NS: Send review notification to QC SPOC
            NS->>NS: Queue review notification
            
            WS-->>API: Report submitted successfully
            API-->>MOBILE: Return success response
            MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Report submitted for review"
        end
    end
    
    Note over FS,AS: Report Review Process Begins
    
    NS->>QC: Send email notification
    NS->>UI: Send real-time notification (WebSocket)
    Note over NS,UI: If QC SPOC is online
    
    QC->>UI: Login and check notifications
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/notifications?unread=true
    API->>NS: Get unread notifications
    NS->>DB: Query notifications for user
    DB-->>NS: Return notifications
    NS-->>API: Return notification list
    API-->>UI: Display notifications
    UI-->>QC: Show "New report for review" notifications
    
    QC->>UI: Click on review notification
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/activity-reports?status=PENDING_REVIEW&assigned-to-me=true
    API->>WS: Get reports pending review
    WS->>DB: Query reports assigned to QC SPOC
    DB-->>WS: Return pending reports
    WS-->>API: Return report list
    API-->>UI: Display review queue
    UI-->>QC: Show reports awaiting review
    
    QC->>UI: Click on specific report to review
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/activity-reports/{id}?include=facility,attachments
    API->>WS: Get detailed report
    WS->>DB: Query report with all related data
    DB-->>WS: Return complete report
    WS-->>API: Return report details
    API-->>UI: Display report review interface
    UI-->>QC: Show report details, photos, checklist
    
    QC->>QC: Review submitted data and attachments
    Note over QC: Examine photos, verify data, check compliance
    
    alt QC Review Decision: Approve
        QC->>UI: Click "Approve" report
        UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/activity-reports/{id}/review
        Note over API: Body: { "action": "APPROVE", "comments": "..." }
        API->>WS: Process approval
        
        WS->>DB: Begin transaction
        WS->>DB: Update report status to APPROVED
        WS->>DB: Set reviewed_by and reviewed_at
        WS->>DB: Store review comments
        DB-->>WS: Review recorded
        
        WS->>DB: Update facility_activities status to APPROVED
        DB-->>WS: Facility activity approved
        
        WS->>DB: Commit transaction
        DB-->>WS: Approval processed
        
        WS->>AS: Log approval audit
        AS->>DB: Store approval audit
        DB-->>AS: Audit logged
        
        WS->>NS: Send approval notification to field staff and SPOC
        NS->>MOBILE: Send push notification to field staff
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Report approved"
        NS->>UI: Send notification to Activity SPOC
        UI-->>SPOC: Show "Report approved" (if online)
        
        WS-->>API: Approval processed successfully
        API-->>UI: Return success response
        UI-->>QC: Show "Report approved successfully"
        
    else QC Review Decision: Reject
        QC->>UI: Click "Reject" and provide detailed comments
        UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/activity-reports/{id}/review
        Note over API: Body: { "action": "REJECT", "comments": "Detailed feedback..." }
        API->>WS: Process rejection
        
        WS->>DB: Begin transaction
        WS->>DB: Update report status to REJECTED
        WS->>DB: Set reviewed_by, reviewed_at, and comments
        DB-->>WS: Rejection recorded
        
        WS->>DB: Update facility_activities status to IN_PROGRESS
        DB-->>WS: Facility activity reset for rework
        
        WS->>DB: Commit transaction
        DB-->>WS: Rejection processed
        
        WS->>AS: Log rejection audit
        AS->>DB: Store rejection audit
        DB-->>AS: Audit logged
        
        WS->>NS: Send rejection notification with feedback
        NS->>MOBILE: Send push notification with comments
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Report rejected" with feedback
        NS->>UI: Send notification to Activity SPOC
        UI-->>SPOC: Show "Report rejected" notification
        
        WS-->>API: Rejection processed successfully
        API-->>UI: Return success response
        UI-->>QC: Show "Report rejected, feedback sent"
        
    else QC Review Decision: Flag for Field QC
        QC->>UI: Click "Flag for Field QC"
        UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/activity-reports/{id}/review
        Note over API: Body: { "action": "FLAG_FOR_FIELD_QC", "comments": "Requires on-site verification" }
        API->>WS: Process Field QC flag
        
        WS->>DB: Begin transaction
        WS->>DB: Update report status to FLAGGED_FOR_FIELD_QC
        WS->>DB: Set review details and comments
        DB-->>WS: Flag recorded
        
        WS->>DB: Create new facility_activity for Field QC
        Note over WS: Creates Field QC activity for the same facility
        DB-->>WS: Field QC activity created
        
        WS->>DB: Commit transaction
        DB-->>WS: Field QC flag processed
        
        WS->>AS: Log Field QC flag audit
        AS->>DB: Store audit record
        DB-->>AS: Audit logged
        
        WS->>NS: Send Field QC assignment notification
        NS->>UI: Notify Field QC SPOC
        NS->>MOBILE: Notify original field staff
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Flagged for Field QC"
        
        WS-->>API: Field QC flag processed
        API-->>UI: Return success response
        UI-->>QC: Show "Flagged for Field QC successfully"
    end
    
    Note over FS,SPOC: Activity SPOC monitors overall progress
    
    SPOC->>UI: Check activity progress dashboard
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/activity-assignments/{id}/progress
    API->>WS: Get activity progress statistics
    WS->>DB: Query report status counts
    DB-->>WS: Return progress statistics
    WS-->>API: Return progress data
    API-->>UI: Display progress dashboard
    UI-->>SPOC: Show progress (Submitted: X, Approved: Y, Rejected: Z, Field QC: W)
    
    Note over FS,AS: Report lifecycle complete with proper audit trail 